+/*
+ * A maker's PostScript driver package is a PPD (and perhaps plug-ins) on
+ * the system's PostScript driver: its INF names PSCRIPT5.DLL as the driver
+ * and PS5UI.DLL as its configuration.  Ours is wineps.drv, which reads the
+ * maker's PPD; these names lead to it.  The same source builds both.
